*.log
.env

# Generated portable-hub payload (Node runtime + compiled hub) — rebuilt by
# scripts/bundle-hub.mjs during `tauri build`; never commit the shipped binaries.
/apps/desktop/src-tauri/hub-runtime/
/apps/desktop/src-tauri/testbed-runtime/

# Ephemeral parallel-agent git worktrees (isolated checkouts full of node_modules/build
# artifacts). The branches live as refs (worktree-agent-*), so the work is safe; the
# working-dir checkouts are machine-local scratch. Never commit them.
.claude/worktrees/
# Disposable test hub state (scripts/sandbox.mjs) — journal DB, worktrees, config.
.sandbox*/
